  "description": "Storage-agnostic per-tenant API-key authentication for ASP.NET Core services. Generates high-entropy prefixed keys (configurable prefix), stores only a SHA-256 hash, and resolves X-Api-Key / Bearer credentials to a tenant principal via an ASP.NET AuthenticationHandler. The host implements IApiKeyStore over its own database; claim names, role and key prefix are configurable so each product keeps its own contract. Extracted from PROOViD AMLService (2nd consumer: Ichnos).",
